OL,3,GNEWSATwo found dead at house in
OL,4,ACheshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been found dead at a
OL,7,Fhouse in Cheshire.
OL,9,FThe bodies of a 78-year-old man and a
OL,10,F79-year-old woman were found at a
OL,11,Fproperty on Grange Park Avenue in
OL,12,FWilmslow on Saturday, Cheshire Police
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FPolice attended the address following
OL,16,Fconcerns for the welfare of the
OL,17,Foccupants.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
